WEBVTT

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:04.670
Shuwarin?Dreaming
Pastel * Palettes new single
"Shuwarin?Dreaming" on sale now!
Also includes upbeat, yet sentimental
new track "PasParevolutions?"

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:05.630
They're not just cute!
Their musicality will make your heart
bubble up with excitement!

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:08.250
Good morning!

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.170
Aya-san!

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:12.630
Good morning! Just got off work?

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:14.130
I'm exhausted...

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:16.170
Brought some snacks for you guys.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:17.170
Yay!

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:18.920
I'll go make some tea.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.130
I can help!

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.500
Thanks!

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.040
Did you run all the way here?

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:25.120
Your hair's all messed up.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:26.500
What?! Really?

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:30.460
It's sticking up in the back.

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:31.330
Seriously?!

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:32.830
You're eating already?

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:34.090
Why don't you have some too?

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:38.050
Thanks, but I don't like to 
snack right before a show.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:40.040
Show? What show?!

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:45.040
We got an offer to perform 
at a big event soon.

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:47.480
Take a look at this!

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:51.830
Wait, the World Idol Festival?

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:54.630
I hear it's the biggest girl 
group festival in Japan.

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:57.200
More than 100,000 people come and watch it.

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:00.880
The WIF...

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:04.960
The venue's big enough to fit
three Tokyo Domes inside!

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:09.330
Our debut show was pretty big,
but this is on a whole different level!

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:11.000
Our debut show...

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:14.880
There'll be tons of coverage 
at an event this big.

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:16.800
We can't afford a blunder like that again...

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:18.760
W-we're totally fine now!

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:23.390
Yep. We don't want to give them a poor performance,
so let's give this our all.

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:24.630
Okay.
Yeah!

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:59.240
You're performing at a big event, Aya-chan?

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:01.460
Yeah! The WIF!

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:05.000
And it's not just us, lots of
other groups are performing too!

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.920
And we're taking photos for the pamphlet
and doing interviews!

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:09.670
Sounds amazing!

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:11.000
Doesn't it?!

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:14.920
But won't that conflict with filming
for Chisato-chan's TV show?

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:16.800
Don't worry about me.

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:21.470
Just make sure you really practice
your MCing and singing, okay?

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:22.790
S-sure...

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:25.750
Oh, Yura-Yura is on the set list, right?

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:29.270
It's been a while since we've done that one.
Want to practice together?

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:32.230
All right.

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:33.690
Chisato-chan?

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:36.420
Let's talk later. I need to read my script.

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:37.940
Okay. Good luck!

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:39.710
See you later, Kanon-chan.

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:40.710
Okay!

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:43.270
What's Yura-Yura?

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:45.170
"Yura-Yura Ring-Dong-Dance."

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:49.540
It's a duet that Aya-chan and I sing.

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:00.490
I'm loving it! Yeah, that's great!

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:03.830
It's obvious she used to be a pro model.
Just look at her!

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:06.550
Aya-chan's face looked so 
stiff compared to hers.

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:08.250
We're Pastel * Palettes.

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:10.250
She's practicing with the wall over there.
The five of us are going to-

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:10.460
She's practicing with the wall over there.
Wait, that's not it...

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:11.040
Wait, that's not it...

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:13.040
Aya-chan sure cracks me up sometimes.

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:15.290
I think we've got our shots, Eve-san.

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:18.710
That's it for photos today, thank you!

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:20.380
Thank you!

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:21.920
Brilliant work.

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:23.460
Oh, it was nothing at all!

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:23.750
TV Series
A Woman Out of Reach
-Pride-
Episode 8 Revised Ver.

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:26.870
I've gotta get going to my next gig.

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:29.040
I'll meet up with you guys afterwards.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:29.880
Okay!

00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:33.250
Aya-chan, we're all done! Let's go practice!

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.750
Oh, okay!

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.500
Wait, where's Chisato-chan?

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:37.920
She just left.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.380
She has filming today.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:40.290
What?

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:43.500
Back to back? That sounds like a lot...

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:49.750
A single woman in her prime,
about to cross into new territory...

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:51.330
Isn't that Chisato Shirasagi?

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:51.750
A Woman Out of Reach
-Pride-
Airing Fridays at Midnight

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:52.750
Playing the daughter?

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:55.210
She's in a girl group, Pastel * Palettes!

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:57.020
What's the show about?

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:59.040
Manager

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:01.290
Chisato here.

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:04.290
I just finished up with PasuPare,
heading your way now...

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:07.490
It's been delayed two hours?

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:10.040
Okay. Thanks.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:16.000
Music studio

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.800
I'm so bad when it comes to trains...

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:26.050
Train Guide
(24 min)
1 Stop
[Departure] Shinjuku

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:27.920
Uh, next I need to...

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:29.540
Looking for Studio Lop?

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:31.380
Tae-chan!

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:33.670
It's near the next station.

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:35.960
What brings you way out here?

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:38.460
I thought I'd walk to work today.

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:39.940
Without an umbrella?

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:42.750
You know what they say 
about singin' in the rain.

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:46.040
Are you going to the studio?

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:49.540
Y-yeah... I'm kind of in a rush. See ya!

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.500
This looks like the place.

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:03.050
Hello?

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:04.130
Welcome!

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:05.840
Tae-chan?! What are you-?

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:08.510
Glad you made it here okay.

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:13.420
Would you like to make any changes to your
1-hour solo reservation, Miss Shirasagi?

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:16.420
It's fine... Is this where you work...?

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:18.520
I'll help you set up your bass.

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:19.770
Tae-chan!

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:22.960
Could you keep this a secret?

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:24.860
Me, coming to practice here?

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:30.460
That was great, Aya-san!

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:31.580
Really?

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:35.130
You messed up the dance a 
little, but it was cute!

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:36.830
Y-you saw that?

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:40.630
That's our Hina-san. Eyes like a hawk!

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:44.830
Chisato-chan!

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:45.710
Hey!

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:49.170
Hi guys. Sorry I'm late!

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:51.260
I'll get ready right now.

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:56.170
Well, it's getting pretty 
late. Let's do one last song!

00:06:56.170 --> 00:06:57.670
I wanna do "Yura-Yura"!

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:00.080
Maybe next time!

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:02.020
What were you thinking, Hina-chan?

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:04.110
I'm okay with whatever!

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:06.080
What were you guys playing before?

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:07.790
Pasupa Revolutions.

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:09.830
Why don't we finish up with that one then?

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:12.660
O-okay, sounds good.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.420
Let's put all our energy into this one!

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:15.830
I'll count us down.

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.580
1, 2, 3, 4!

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:42.170
Hina

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:23.450
Hmm, something feels off, Chisato-chan.

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:24.580
What is it?

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:29.500
Your bass always sounds really boomy,
but today it was kinda bleh.

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:32.330
Can I see your bass for a second?

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:33.170
Sure.

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:37.290
Your strings are looking pretty worn down.

00:08:37.590 --> 00:08:38.830
I was right!

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:41.210
Do you have any spares?
I can switch them out for you.

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:42.380
Thanks.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.290
Don't overdo it, okay?

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:58.750
Hi there.
Pastel * Palettes seem to be really busy lately.
How are you doing, Chisato-san?

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:01.930
Are you getting enough sleep...?
Should I come bring you some
ninja candy sometime soon...?

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:01.930
Eve-chan.

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:09.670
Hiya!
Your filming sounds like a lot of work.
Are you doing okay?

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:11.920
Hiya!
Your filming sounds like a lot of work.
Are you doing okay?

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:13.790
Hiya!
Your filming sounds like a lot of work.
Are you doing okay?
Let me know if there's anything
I can do to help!

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:21.160
Your filming sounds like a lot of work.
Are you doing okay?
Let me know if there's anything
I can do to help!
Just make sure your part sounds perfect
before we all meet up next, Aya-chan!

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:22.790
I will!

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:28.170
What are you doing here?

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:29.630
I work here.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:31.790
You sure get around to a lot of places...

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:33.130
Same with you, Chisato-senpai.

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:35.290
Well, I...

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:41.330
So, what came up in search this time?

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:46.100
Girl Group Fakes Playing Their
Instruments at Debut Show!!!

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:46.100
Isn't that an article from our debut show?

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:48.600
Our debut show...

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:04.460
Sorry, everyone!

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:08.330
Due to some technical difficulties,
we weren't able to perform live today.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:12.130
But we're going to keep performing
at shows for you guys!

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:15.000
We hope to see you all again soon!

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:17.600
For now, that's it for Pastel * Palettes!

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:23.380
Well, we had to lip sync and fake-play
our instruments that night.

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:27.190
I don't know what we would have done
without Chisato-san.

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:28.140
Yeah.

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:31.710
But we play our instruments for real now,
and you really sing!

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:32.960
We'll be fine!

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:33.630
Yeah!

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:38.750
Let's make this show a huge success and
show them all who Pastel * Palettes truly are!

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:40.080
I'll give it everything I've got!

00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:41.380
I'll do my best too!

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:43.750
Yeah! Let's go, BUSHIDO!

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:44.370
Huh?

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:45.460
Yeah!

00:10:46.920 --> 00:10:49.710
So you sing too, Chisato-senpai?

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:53.880
Yeah. Aya-chan and I have one duet together.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:55.960
Playing and singing at 
the same time is tough.

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:59.250
Kasumi talks about it all the time.

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:03.390
Sometimes if it's too hard, 
I take over those parts.

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:07.130
I see. Guess that's a benefit of
having two guitarists, huh.

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:09.600
Can't you do that with two vocalists too?

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:12.400
I can't...

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:14.400
yet.

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:18.290
O-Tae! Lunch time!

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:19.170
Okay!

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:20.380
Kasumi-san!

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:24.500
Eve-chan! I saw your posters! 
For that big live event.

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:26.540
You mean the WIF?

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:29.660
It stands for World Idol Festival.

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:32.250
Oh! Are you guys super busy preparing?

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:35.880
Chisato-san seems to be...

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:39.000
We haven't been able to 
practice together much.

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.470
Chisato-senpai's been-

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:47.330
Tae-chan, can a borrow you for a sec?

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:50.560
These are for you.

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:53.540
Bunny tail pastries?

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:55.630
I heard they're really popular.

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:56.600
They are!

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:58.790
Wait, is this hush money?!

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:04.920
Eve was really worried about you.

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:09.080
How come you won't tell them
you've been practicing on your own?

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:12.370
When you stand up on stage,
people expect you to be able to play.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:17.090
Those people watching don't know how many hours
you've poured into practicing... Right?

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:21.880
And neither do Aya-senpai 
and the others, do they...

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:24.290
Correct. They don't need to know.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:28.570
If I can't sing and play at the same time,
I can't practice with them anyways.

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:32.140
I don't want to waste their time.

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:37.920
Prodigies like Hina can pick anything up
and immediately be good at it.

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:40.140
Me? Not so much...

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:44.670
Ninja Art of Camouflage... Nin-nin!

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:46.040
You too, Kasumi!

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:47.570
Nin-nin!

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:50.580
That looks like a Yamabuki Bakery bag!

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:51.700
Yamabuki Bakery

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:51.700
Yamabuki?

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:53.500
A bribe!

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:59.710
What's the matter, Eve-san?

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:02.550
N-nothing at all!

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:04.210
Are you worried about something?

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:06.960
What are you hiding?

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:07.760
Eeek!

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:10.060
A ninja never reveals a secret!

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:14.600
But reporting new intel to allies
is the number one job of a ninja!

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:16.500
You're right.

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:18.940
Well...

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:22.190
I think I saw something. 
Involving Chisato-san.

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:24.260
Don't tell me she's in some kind of scandal!

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:24.710
What?!

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:26.540
This could be a big problem! With who?!

00:13:27.710 --> 00:13:28.830
With Tae-san...

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:29.920
Tae-chan?

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:32.370
I saw Tae-san and Chisato-san...

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:35.080
with a Yamabuki Bakery bag...

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:36.500
Of pastries?

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:38.330
It was a bribe!

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:39.560
Hi guys.

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:40.960
There you are, Chisato-san!

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:42.080
Hina-san! Shh!

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:43.210
What's going on?

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:45.040
Chisato-chan...

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:46.440
What is it?

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:48.420
Um...

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:53.330
Eve-chan, is something wrong?

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:58.210
Um... Uh... With this, I 
shall vanish from sight!

00:13:58.210 --> 00:13:59.000
Eve-san!

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:04.650
What is going on here...?

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:06.290
Truthfully...

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:09.310
Ah, you saw us then?

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:12.460
I was just giving her some
famous pastries I discovered.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:15.920
There, Aya-chan.

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:21.540
Chisato-san, you're coming 
to practice today, right?

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:24.420
I have to shoot some pick-ups,
so just for half an hour.

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:25.710
That's plenty!

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:29.080
U-um, I really want to practice Yura-Yura!

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:30.830
W-would that be all right?

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:31.930
Why so polite?

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:35.560
Okay.

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:37.310
Thanks!

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:40.000
Can we do the singing 
parts next time, though?

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:42.170
I want to focus on my bass for now.

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:45.420
'Kay.

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:55.250
Hmm...

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:58.000
It's missing its spark...

00:14:58.960 --> 00:14:59.790
Sor-

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:00.460
Sorry!

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:03.540
I couldn't concentrate at all.

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:04.790
Aya-san...

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:06.710
Can we try it one more time?

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:11.220
Chisato-chan, if it's okay with you,
can we rehearse it like it's the real thing?

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:14.900
I mean, it's our duet after all...

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:17.210
If that's too hard, maybe we can just sing-

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:19.290
But that wouldn't be like 
the real thing, would it?

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:21.380
But I want to sing with you-

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:22.460
I don't!

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.540
I'm sorry. I didn't mean that...

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:33.000
It's fine. I just need to wash my face.

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:34.040
Aya-san!

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.080
Uh-oh...

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:42.000
I should get back to the film set...

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:46.550
It's really coming down.

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:49.830
Do you think Aya-san will come to practice?

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:52.630
I don't think she'd just 
blow it off. It IS work.

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:57.750
We can't let things stay the way they are
or we'll end up drifting apart.

00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:59.680
I want to help somehow...

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:01.250
Me too...

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:05.130
I'm always the one depending on
Aya-san and Chisato-san for help,

00:16:05.430 --> 00:16:07.920
so I don't really know what to do
in a situation like this.

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:10.420
You do so much to support 
this group, Maya-san!

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:12.630
Yeah! You're the most 
consistent performance-wise.

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:14.080
We really depend on you.

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:15.960
Y-you really think so?

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:21.210
Well then, I'll do my best to support
PasuPare with my drums!

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:24.080
Let's show everyone what 
PasuPare is really like!

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:27.540
Well, it's no fun unless
all five of us are together, right?

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.170
Hina-san!

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:35.330
Sorry to interrupt...

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:36.300
O-oh, hi guys.

00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:37.420
Aya-san!

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:39.670
You're early... We didn't know if you'd come.

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:42.710
I gave it some though last night.

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:47.880
Maybe the reason Chisato-chan didn't want to
sing with me is because I'm no good...

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:48.670
No way-

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:51.530
So all I can really do is push myself harder!

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:54.420
So you came early to do vocal exercises?

00:16:56.620 --> 00:17:00.210
I think Chisato-san actually does
want to sing with you.

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:05.380
If she didn't, she wouldn't have practiced
to the point of wearing out her bass strings.

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:11.040
Do you feel that spark now, Aya-chan?

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:17.010
Hina-chan,

00:17:17.610 --> 00:17:19.680
Eve-chan, Maya-chan...

00:17:21.780 --> 00:17:22.810
I'll be right back!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:36.910
Rainy Ring-Dong-Dance

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:36.920
Chisato-chan!

00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:38.170
Hey!

00:17:38.170 --> 00:17:39.580
What are you doing here?

00:17:44.920 --> 00:17:46.670
I'll wait for you!

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:52.960
I'm not very dependable,
and there's not much I'm good at...

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:54.920
All I can do is give it my best shot...

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:57.560
But I can wait!

00:17:58.010 --> 00:18:00.760
Until you think I'm good enough
for us to sing together!

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:02.290
I'll be waiting, okay?

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.670
That's my Aya-chan.

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:15.380
Huh?

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:20.210
The fact that you came here sort of feels like
you're doing the opposite of waiting, you know.

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:21.750
What? I'm sorry!

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:31.130
I reserved a studio nearby until I have to
go back and film. Want to join me?

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.670
Is that all right?

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:35.630
I can't say I'm perfect yet,

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:39.500
but I'm not about to send 
you back sopping wet.

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:42.830
Thank you.

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:45.670
Aya-chan, we're supposed to be idols...

00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:47.000
No more tears.

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:49.890
Aya-san!

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:51.610
Chisato-san!

00:18:52.220 --> 00:18:52.920
You guys!

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:55.080
Guess that settles that!

00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:58.380
I was gonna go practice for a bit.
Want to go together?

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:00.080
Are you sure?

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:01.170
I'm sure.

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:04.880
After practice, let's all go 
eat some hot pot together!

00:19:04.880 --> 00:19:07.660
Like the old saying! Friends 
eat from the same pot!

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:09.290
That sounds good...
I think you might be taking that a bit too literally...

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:09.880
I think you might be taking 
that a bit too literally...

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:13.590
All five of us are coming.

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:15.290
All five of us are coming.

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:16.880
I'll be waiting when you get here.

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:18.590
All five of us are coming.
I'll be waiting when you get here.

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:21.920
This show is one of Japan's biggest events.

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:24.500
That's what I heard, anyways...

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:27.140
Our stage looks pretty small, though.

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:29.330
I guess it suits us!

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:31.920
We'll give it our all, 
no matter where we are!

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:34.420
I, I'm getting kinda nervous...

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:37.940
It's all right. You can turn that
nervousness into strength.

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:41.540
Y-you're right. Everyone, put your hands in!

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:43.460
Ready!

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:44.330
Huddle up!

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:45.750
Aya-san, you do the honors!

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:46.630
Okay!

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:47.830
Ready?

00:19:48.110 --> 00:19:50.200
Man-Maru O-Yama ni Irodori-

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:51.560
PasuPare!

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:54.040
Yeah!

00:19:54.390 --> 00:19:55.920
Bushido!

00:21:46.440 --> 00:21:48.460
And that's the show!

00:21:48.460 --> 00:21:50.370
We're Pastel * Palettes!

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:52.880
Thanks, everyone!

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:38.640
Next episode: You Only Live Once
